Package: chromodoris
Title: Chromodoris Plots of Many Time Series
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jeffrey", "Girard", , "me@jmgirard.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for the Chromodoris plot, which summarizes many time
    series (one per rater or unit) moment by moment as nested quantile
    ribbons around a center line. This development version installs and
    checks but exports no functions yet; a ggplot2 stat and a plotting
    wrapper are planned.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/jmgirard/chromodoris
BugReports: https://github.com/jmgirard/chromodoris/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: 
    cli,
    ggplot2,
    rlang
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
